<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Cascade raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Cascade raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it raised its rating on Cascade Communications Corp to strong buy from outperform.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares were up 3-1/8 at 65.</p>
</text>
